                        suggested by <persName type="inline" ref="#hon">O'Neill</persName></figDesc>
                  </figure>
               </item>
               <item xml:id="f4v_il">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="full" url="https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1006083/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
                     <head>Illustration on f4v</head>
                     <figDesc>Potentially Convulvula Ipomea suggested by <persName type="inline" ref="#tcp">Petersen</persName>.</figDesc>
                  </figure>
               </item>
               <item xml:id="f5r_il">
                  <figure>
                     <graphic type="full" url="https://collections.library.yale.edu/iiif/2/1006084/full/full/0/default.jpg"/>
                     <head>Illustration on f5r</head>
                     <figDesc>Potentially [Herba] Paris, Indian Cucumber suggested by <persName
